    <h2>1. What is SEO?</h2>
    <p><b>SEO = Search Engine Optimization = Make Google show YOUR website first.</b></p>
    <p>When someone searches "Best Biryani in Lahore" on Google, Google shows 10 websites. The first website gets 30% of all clicks. The 10th gets 2%. SEO is how you get to #1.</p>
    <p>You built a beautiful website. But if nobody finds it on Google, it is like a shop in a desert - No customers. SEO brings customers to your shop for FREE, every day, without ads.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>3 Types:</b> 1. On-Page SEO - What you control on your page - Title, headings, content. 2. Technical SEO - Speed, mobile, links work. 3. Off-Page SEO - Other websites link to you. Today we learn On-Page + Technical - The 80% that matters.</div>
    <h2>2. LIVE DEMO - SEO Checker + Google Preview</h2>
    <p>Type your title and description. See how Google will show it + Your SEO score:</p>
    <div class="demo-card">
      <div class="seo-wrap">
        <h3 style="text-align:center;margin:0">🔍 SEO Checker - Try It</h3>
