    <h2>3. The 7 On-Page SEO Rules</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>Rule</th><th>Example - Good vs Bad</th></tr>
      <tr><td>1</td><td>Title - 50-60 chars, keyword first</td><td>✅ "Best Biryani in Lahore - Fresh Delivery" ❌ "Home - Welcome - My Site"</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2</td><td>Description - 120-160 chars, benefit + keyword</td><td>✅ "Order best biryani... delivered in 30 min" ❌ No description</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3</td><td>One H1 Only - Main heading</td><td>✅ One &lt;h1&gt; with keyword ❌ 5 H1s or no H1</td></tr>
      <tr><td>4</td><td>Headings Order - H1 → H2 → H3</td><td>✅ H1, then H2, then H3 ❌ H1, then H5, then H2</td></tr>
      <tr><td>5</td><td>Images Alt Text - Describe image</td><td>✅ alt="Chicken Biryani in Lahore" ❌ alt="" or alt="img123"</td></tr>
      <tr><td>6</td><td>URL - Short, keyword, dashes</td><td>✅ /biryani-in-lahore ❌ /page?id=123&x=abc</td></tr>
      <tr><td>7</td><td>Content - Answer the question</td><td>✅ 300+ words, useful, keyword 2-3 times ❌ 20 words, keyword 20 times (spam)</td></tr>
    </table>
    <h2>4. Complete SEO Code - Copy This to Every Page</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;html</span> <span class="attr">lang</span>=<span class="val">"en"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;head&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">charset</span>=<span class="val">"UTF-8"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="val">"viewport"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- 1. Title - Most important - 50-60 chars --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;title&gt;</span><span class="text">Best Biryani in Lahore - Fresh Delivery in 30 Min</span><span class="tag">&lt;/title&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- 2. Description - Shows on Google - 120-160 chars --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="val">"description"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"Order best chicken biryani in Lahore. Hot, fresh, delivered in 30 minutes. Cash on delivery."</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- 3. Keywords - Helps Google understand topic --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="val">"keywords"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"biryani in lahore, chicken biryani, biryani delivery"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- 4. Canonical - Main URL, avoid duplicate --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;link</span> <span class="attr">rel</span>=<span class="val">"canonical"</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"https://yourwebsite.com/biryani-in-lahore"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- 5. Open Graph - How it looks on WhatsApp / Facebook --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">property</span>=<span class="val">"og:title"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"Best Biryani in Lahore"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">property</span>=<span class="val">"og:description"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"Hot, fresh biryani delivered in 30 minutes."</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;meta</span> <span class="attr">property</span>=<span class="val">"og:image"</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="val">"https://yourwebsite.com/biryani.jpg"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;body&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span class="text">Best Biryani in Lahore</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h1&gt;</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- Only ONE H1 --&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span class="text">Why Our Biryani is Best</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="val">"biryani.jpg"</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="val">"Chicken Biryani in Lahore - Fresh and Hot"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/body&gt;</span> <span class="tag">&lt;/html&gt;</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>5. Technical SEO - Speed + Mobile</h2>
    <p>Google ranks FAST + MOBILE websites higher. 1 second delay = 7% less sales.</p>
    <p>1. <b>Mobile First:</b> 80% users are on mobile. Test at 360px. If it breaks on mobile, Google drops you.<br>2. <b>Speed:</b> Compress images - Use TinyPNG.com - Big images = Slow site = Low rank. Aim under 3 seconds.<br>3. <b>No Broken Links:</b> Click every link. Broken link = Google thinks site is dead.<br>4. <b>HTTPS:</b> Your site must start with https:// not http:// - Netlify / Vercel give free HTTPS.<br>5. <b>Google Search Console:</b> Free tool - Go to search.google.com/search-console - Add your site - Google will start showing it.</p>
    <h2>6. Keyword Research - Free Way</h2>
    <p>Do NOT guess keywords. Check what people actually search:</p>
    <p>1. Type in Google - "biryani in..." - Google suggests - "biryani in lahore, biryani in karachi" - Those are real keywords<br>2. Scroll to bottom - "People also search for" - More keywords<br>3. Use Google Keyword Planner - Free - Shows how many people search each month</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Golden Rule:</b> One page = One keyword. Do not try to rank one page for "biryani, pizza, burger, shawarma" all together. Make separate pages - One for biryani, one for pizza. Each page targets one keyword.</div>
    <h2>7. Homework - SEO Your Final Project</h2>
    <p>Take your Lesson 45 Final Project and add SEO:</p>
    <p>1. Title 50-60 chars with keyword - e.g. "Fresh Mart Lahore - Fresh Fruits & Vegetables Delivery"<br>2. Description 120-160 chars with benefit<br>3. One H1 only, H2s in order, all images with alt text<br>4. Compress all images on TinyPNG, test speed on pagespeed.web.dev<br>5. Submit site to Google Search Console</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> SEO = Make Google show YOUR site first | Title = 50-60 chars, keyword first | Description = 120-160 chars, benefit + keyword | One H1 only, H2 → H3 order | Images = Alt text with keyword | URL = Short, keyword, dashes | Speed = Compress images, under 3 sec | Mobile = Test at 360px | One page = One keyword | Submit to Google Search Console</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> <a href="/lesson47">Lesson 47 - Deploy Free</a> - Put your website LIVE on internet. Free hosting, free domain, free HTTPS.</p>
